OL,3,GNEWSAReport calls for tougher action on
OL,4,Adrugs in prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe availability of illicit drugs in a
OL,7,FKent prison is continuing to pose a
OL,8,Fmajor threat to safety and security
OL,9,Fdespite improvements at the facility, a
OL,10,Freport has said.
OL,12,FThe Independent Monitoring Board (IMB)
OL,13,Ffor HMP Rochester said the arrival and
OL,14,Fmanagement of an older cohort of
OL,15,Fprisoners had initially placed
OL,16,F"considerable strain" on the prison but
OL,17,Fit had adapted well.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
