OL,3,GNEWSAReport calls for tougher action on
OL,4,Adrugs in prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, the number of men using drugs
OL,7,Fremained a serious concern, it said,
OL,8,Fwhile cuts to education provision had
OL,9,Fled to prisoners spending longer in
OL,10,Fcells with fewer prospects for
OL,11,Frehabilitation.
OL,13,FThe Ministry of Justice has been
OL,14,Fcontacted for comment.
